manifest={'frozen':True,'captured_at':datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),'build_description':'SUMMIT with six worlds including Tron, deterministic measurement-derived achievements, per-block execution analysis and expedition modes.','allowed_files':files,'sha256':{p:sha(root/p) for p in files},'build_sha256':{str(p.relative_to(root)):sha(p) for p in sorted((root/'dist').rglob('*')) if p.is_file()},'screenshots':shots,'runtime_notes':['All screenshots are automated browser captures with isolated in-memory APIs. Historical measured-looking records are synthetic fixtures, not actual exercise.','Active scenes are demos with accelerated time; no physical exertion, real-world FPS, actual sound experience or longitudinal enjoyment was measured.','Sensor smoke used mock BLE with actual realtime packet sampling, temporary SQLite restart and Garmin FIT decoding. Hardware BLE bike was previously confirmed by user; HR and ANT hardware were not tested here.','Tron has four explicit performance achievements. Existing Neon/Sky expedition cores are earned by accumulated on-target seconds; no random drops. Demo progress never contributes to saved real campaign.','The per-interval analysis modal was widened after first runtime pass; analysis images were recaptured against final width. New scene sector shots use current final build.','Current unit/backend suite100passing; sensor smoke19checks. Graphics use headless software WebGL2 fallback. No hardware performance benchmark is claimed.']}
(root/'evaluation-v2/evidence-manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(manifest,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2))
print('Frozen',len(files),'files; manifest SHA256',sha(root/'evaluation-v2/evidence-manifest.json'))
